BOSS Colossus Phase 2B Golems Spawn Q
    Events
        Unit - A unit enters ColossusSpot <gen>
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to BossColossus
        (BossColossus is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Unit - Pause BossColossus
        Animation - Play BossColossus's spell slam animation
        Sound - Play Colossus05 <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
        Wait 1.05 seconds
        -------- unpause + animations for boss --------
        Unit - Unpause BossColossus
        Unit - Make BossColossus Vulnerable
        Unit - Set BossColossus movement speed to ((Default movement speed of BossColossus) x 0.25)
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Attack Once (Random unit from (Units in DragonFireSpam01 <gen> matching (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of Player 12 (Brown).) Equal to True)))
        Animation - Queue BossColossus's stand animation
        -------- Get BossColossus location and facing angle --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossusTempPoint = (Position of BossColossus)
        -------- Calculate the location 750 units away BossColossus - multiple angles --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossus_GolemPoint[1] = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 750.00 towards 0.00 degrees.)
        Set VariableSet BossColossus_GolemPoint[2] = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 750.00 towards 90.00 degrees.)
        Set VariableSet BossColossus_GolemPoint[3] = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 750.00 towards 180.00 degrees.)
        Set VariableSet BossColossus_GolemPoint[4] = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 750.00 towards 270.00 degrees.)
        -------- Create golem spawns around Colossus --------
        Unit - Create 1 Golem Spawn (Boss Phase) for Player 12 (Brown) at BossColossus_GolemPoint[1] facing BossColossusTempPoint
        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to BossColossus_Golems
        Sound - Play RockGolemPissed2 <gen> at 50.00% volume, attached to (Last created unit)
        Unit - Create 1 Golem Spawn (Boss Phase) for Player 12 (Brown) at BossColossus_GolemPoint[2] facing BossColossusTempPoint
        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to BossColossus_Golems
        Sound - Play RockGolemPissed2 <gen> at 50.00% volume, attached to (Last created unit)
        Unit - Create 1 Golem Spawn (Boss Phase) for Player 12 (Brown) at BossColossus_GolemPoint[3] facing BossColossusTempPoint
        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to BossColossus_Golems
        Sound - Play RockGolemPissed1 <gen> at 50.00% volume, attached to (Last created unit)
        Unit - Create 1 Golem Spawn (Boss Phase) for Player 12 (Brown) at BossColossus_GolemPoint[4] facing BossColossusTempPoint
        Unit Group - Add (Last created unit) to BossColossus_Golems
        Sound - Play RockGolemAttack1 <gen> at 50.00% volume, attached to (Last created unit)
        -------- "birth" --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BossColossus_Golems and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Unit - Make (Picked unit) Invulnerable
                Unit - Pause (Picked unit)
                Animation - Play (Picked unit)'s birth animation
        Wait 2.00 seconds
        -------- Issue to move towards Colossus --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BossColossus_Golems and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Animation - Queue (Picked unit)'s stand animation
                Unit - Make (Picked unit) Vulnerable
                Unit - Unpause (Picked unit)
                Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Attack BossColossus
        -------- Clean up memory leaks --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossusTempPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossus_GolemPoint[1])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossus_GolemPoint[2])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossus_GolemPoint[3])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossus_GolemPoint[4])
        -------- turn on golems dead trigg --------
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 2B Golems Dead <gen>
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Colossus Phase 2B Golems Issue Move <gen>
